| PA0 | ADC1_IN0 | ADC |
| PA4 | W25Q128 CS | SPI1（软件控制） |
| PA5 | SPI1_SCK | SPI1 |
| PA6 | SPI1_MISO | SPI1 |
| PA7 | SPI1_MOSI | SPI1 |
| PB6 | I2C1_SCL | I2C1 |
| PB7 | I2C1_SDA | I2C1 |
| PC0-PC7 | LED | GPIO 输出 |
| PC13 | KEY | GPIO 输入 |
| PD8 | USART3_TX | USART3 |
| PD9 | USART3_RX | USART3 |

